   184	| **The hold** (method; not a fragment) | M1 taught as a discipline and given failure modes (Shadow drifting at dusk, Anchor's wants); M2 inverted at the ford (bait with one, kill with everything that isn't one); M5 dropped all at once inside the Ring | A sequence of small refusals, "arriving faster than a person could name them" |
