    58	
    59	The bench's days and weather; the herd's look and sound; the exact choreography inside the planted geometry (fin, split, cart, boxes); Oryn's first look at each of them; the walk down; the yard at Oxhollow; which patients come to the table; Lira's and Oryn's windows; humor (Brom's "Carrying." / "Not pulling."; Lira on a mule not mentioning the mule).
    60	
