   126	
   127	*Seln quoted Pike: never be below them, never be loud below them. We are below them. Every cart Oxhollow ever sends will be below them. So the rule out here is the second half, and we've been keeping it since the Line without knowing it had a second half. Karis gets tomorrow. So do I.*
