   204	
   205	*Seventy-sixth day. Fourth camp. Eight narrowings; the eighth is a cart and no more, and the edge is a break, not a crumble. Karis has it in the book with the break drawn. Two-thirds of the way by Pike's count of days, a little under by mine.*
