   210	
   211	"I know how," Lira said, with her eyes shut.
   212	
   213	"Hands on. That's the only way it works." Oryn said it as a thing she said often, to a room, before anyone asked. "Two years on these roads and I've never done a thing to anyone from over there. And I can't do it to me." She got up, which took her two tries. "Arm."
