    65	It was *ground*. Nothing in those three lines of careful writing had teeth. He looked for the opponent in it, from a habit as old as his reading, and found a shelf, and a gorge, and a question about a wheel. Somebody wanted a mountain looked at closely and written down, with numbers, by people who would say what they had counted and no more. The paper named no tier and no rank. It asked for a cart and a count.
    66	
